&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take ownership and prioritize well in a startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re well-rounded rather than a lone hero - you cover gaps across the stack and reliably own the day-to-day and less-complex work, freeing the team to focus on the hardest problems.&lt;/li&gt;
