&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focal Systems is a pioneering Silicon Valley startup, leading the charge in retail AI solutions. We&#39;re on a mission to automate and optimize brick-and-mortar retail using cutting-edge deep learning computer vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve already made a significant impact, with our solutions deployed at scale with some of the world&#39;s top retailers and we&#39;re expanding rapidly and looking for exceptional talent to join our journey within our North American Retail Consulting team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
