&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrating Measurable ROI to the Customer &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll serve as a strategic advisor to our customers, helping them define, implement, and adopt best practices that align with their goals. A crucial part of your role will be to quantify the improvements that Focal&#39;s solutions bring to their store operations. You&#39;ll achieve this by constantly monitoring and analyzing their performance, then making proactive, data-driven recommendations that deliver clear, measurable results and help them achieve their desired outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
