&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, interpersonal, and listening skills are essential to connect with all stakeholders and build strong, trusting relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate strategic thinking skills coupled with high intellectual curiosity, allowing you to delve deep into customer problems and align value back to their specific business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You embody a start-up mindset and work ethic that aligns with our company core values. You have the ability, motivation, and energy to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced, often unstructured environment, both independently and as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
